From 2e2a4209b8874e2ac67ef1b2829dffd286265807 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:05:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Freeze declared guard creation at authoritative
 intake

Default kanban.self_work.freeze_guards on. Append only to open guard owners in the same repository/area/tenant across days, otherwise return a definitive pre-write refusal. Preserve immutable receipt replay and existing execution. Sender declarations cannot override authority configuration.

Proof: corrected baseline fails guard tests; all 422 focused selfwork/docs tests pass. Ten policy mutants killed (default/off/kind/owner-kind/closed/area/repository/tenant/type/log). Read-only census of hub boards and shadows found ten declaration rows including replicas, zero guard declarations: zero historical classification changes. Undeclared legacy guards remain outside the explicit contract; no title heuristics. Reversal: set freeze_guards false at intake authority.
